## 🔍 ZIR 예시

### 입력 코드
```zig
fn max(a: i32, b: i32) i32 { return a + b; }
fn max(a: f64, b: f64) f64 { return a + b; }
```

### ZIR 출력
```
[0] fn_begin @0 (params: 2)          // max(i32, i32)
[1] binary_op add %1 %2
[2] fn_end
[3] fn_begin @0 (params: 2)          // max(f64, f64)
[4] binary_op add %5 %6
[5] fn_end
[6] overload_group @0 (signatures: 2, default: 0)
    └─ Signature 0: params=[0,0] return=0 fn_ref=0
    └─ Signature 1: params=[0,0] return=0 fn_ref=3
```

